pkcs11.h: the PKCS #11 interface header (types, constants and the function list) that the
PKCS#11 key store backend compiles against. No library is linked: the module is loaded at run
time with dlopen.

Source:   p11-kit 0.26.5, installed file p11-kit-1/p11-kit/pkcs11.h
          (upstream: https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit, common/pkcs11.h)
Changes:  none
SHA-256:  669d76b12dfdb36001a31685f21f94d8c51d108db6487f5af3724dfbd486699b

